Package: pult
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Pult <pult@localhost>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: adduser, libc6 (>= @GLIBC@), libgssapi-krb5-2, postgresql (>= 15) | postgresql-client (>= 15)
Section: web
Priority: optional
Description: Pult — portal for the IT service desk
 Requests, employee directory, Active Directory, remote support and telephony
 in one web portal. The package installs the service with HTTPS on port 443,
 creates the database in the local PostgreSQL and starts the first-run wizard.
 Upgrades back up the database first and roll back if a migration fails.
